WEBVTT

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:40.060
The kingdom of Femille.

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:42.970
To raise its people to
be great shrine maidens...

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:46.370
...no men are allowed to
live there or even enter it.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:48.740
An all-girl city.

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:53.400
And there's something hidden
there with the magic power...

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.810
...to bless these shrine maidens.

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:01.680
To see whether it's the Claire
Bible we're after or not...

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.690
...is the reason we've come here.

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:08.360
To this little city...

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:16.130
So...

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:19.370
WHY DO I HAVE TO WEAR
THIS GETUP AGAIN?!

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:21.400
What are you talking about?

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:24.910
If only women are allowed in,
of course you have to wear it!

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:29.000
That's what you SAY, but you just
like to dress me up, don't you?!

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:32.450
That just isn't true...
Oh, here it is!

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:35.920
Oh, Gourry, dear!
The finishing touch...

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:40.160
H- Help me!

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:42.990
Oh, Gourry, I'm so
jealous of your hair!

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:46.120
It's at least three
times as long as mine.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:50.690
Oh, no, Master Xellos!
Your hair is just fine!

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:52.660
Just a little here
and a dab there and...

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:54.730
Everyone! Take a look!

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:07.980
How do you like it?
Pretty good job, don't you think?

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:15.850
It worked, Mr. Zelgadis!
Everyone's eyes are glued to you!

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:19.460
I hate this...
I HATE THIS! I'm leaving!

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:23.330
Huh? Oh, come on, Zelly.
What are you so upset about?

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.130
We're just complimenting
you because you're so pretty!

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.600
Exactly! You should have
more self-confidence!

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:31.870
Oh, let me go! I'd sooner die
than be seen in this getup!

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:37.640
Save me! Please, save me!

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:43.210
Fireball!

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.890
Good work, Mr. Zelgadis!

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:53.160
H- Hey!

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:00.040
That's the crest of
the Femille royal family.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.640
Hm? Which probably means...

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:06.170
Lady Miwan? Princess?

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:07.770
Lucky!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.370
Lady Miwan!

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:12.880
Yeah, yeah!
Your princess is right here!

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:16.510
We just saved her
from the clutches of evil!

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:23.790
A runaway? That princess?!

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.830
My daughter is nothing
but an embarrassment.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:29.870
And her shrine maiden's training
was soon to be finished, also...

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:33.000
The princess was training
to be a shrine maiden?

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:35.700
Just as I'd expect of
the royal house of Femille!

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:37.640
It's not like that...

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:43.710
Still, I'd like to thank you
all for returning Miwan to us.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:47.780
Oh, no. It was nothing.
Just happy to help.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.320
I doubt that's why you did it...

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:52.380
It's nothing, REALLY!

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:59.790
Still, I'm relieved that
Miwan was saved by girls.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:02.660
If any men had been with you...

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:06.400
...you all would have been
put to death at once!

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:13.770
Any man who enters the holy kingdom of
Femille, no matter who they are!

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:23.480
So, I'm really glad you're all girls!

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:38.470
Great, I couldn't even
MENTION a reward to her!

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:43.530
Besides that, Femille looks like
it's a worse place than I thought.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:48.440
No kidding! Let's just look for
the Claire Bible and leave, fast!

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:51.420
Mr. Gourry!
You're acting like a man again!

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:54.480
She's right.
Please be more careful.

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.810
Oh, Master Xellos,
you're so cute!

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:22.340
How I envy your wings...

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:29.050
You're...

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.780
I... I didn't
mean to disturb you.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.150
Thank you for saving my life.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:44.070
But, at the same time, it meant
an end to my escape from home...

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:54.780
What is your name?

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:57.080
Zel... Uh, it's Lulu.

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:02.150
Would you be angry to hear I was
jealous of you and your friends?

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:07.390
It was my mother who
decided my future was...

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.550
...to be a great shrine maiden.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:14.660
My feelings had nothing to
do with it. It's my destiny.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:19.160
But I can't stand it any more!

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:21.170
I hate this false life I lead...

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:26.210
You who can travel freely
probably can't understand.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:31.810
It's easy to change the future.

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:40.020
Uh, I mean, I'm sure it wouldn't be
hard for you to change your future.

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.760
You're a very nice person, Miss Lulu.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:52.330
Lulu, it's time we were LEAVING the
city. Hope I'm not interrupting!

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:54.130
You idiot!

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:56.300
Let's... GO!

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.720
Zel, you sly dog!

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:06.340
It... It's not like that!

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.170
The future... CAN be changed...

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:41.520
Man, this place really
is full of shrine maidens.

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:45.390
Come on, Lina!
Let's finish this up soon!

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.220
I don't want to stay
in this outfit forever!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:52.890
I know. Okay, first we look
for any info on the Claire Bible!

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.460
Guys, let's do our best!

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:35.930
The purification spring?

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:39.140
Yes, the spring where girls who
want to become shrine maidens...

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:40.840
...go to purify
their bodies and souls.

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:43.880
That's right.

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:47.780
To become one, there's a sacred
monolith in the spring that you touch.

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:51.120
Once you do, your body
and spirit are cleansed...

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.220
...and you're sure to
become a great shrine maiden!

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:01.920
Oh, how mysterious!

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.430
Just touch it and you
become a shrine maiden?

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.440
Meaning it passes magical
power to whoever touches it?

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:10.070
It isn't too strange to think that
a magical item that powerful...

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:13.540
...would be a
Claire Bible manuscript!

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:15.770
ALL RIGHT!

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:19.440
Once Zel and Amelia get here,
we'll set out at once!

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:22.950
What's with her? I'd swear
she was a man or something!

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:28.450
Oh, come on! A beautiful
gal like me, a man?

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:30.090
No way!

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:43.370
All the information I could get
was about that purification spring...

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:56.410
I didn't set out on this journey
to end up in this freak show...

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:03.860
Would you be angry to hear I was
jealous of you and your friends?

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.660
I hate this false life I lead...

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:12.660
A false life, huh?

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.140
Miwan?

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:23.410
Mr. Zelgadis?

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:27.010
Mr. Zelgadis...

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:43.540
I DON'T BELIEVE IT!

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.480
Just HOW would
anyone think that I'm a guy?!

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:51.580
I don't care if they apologized
for saying I was a guy!

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:53.390
The nerve of that girl!

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:57.360
Oh, I haven't eaten
enough to feel better yet!

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:58.950
Hey, lady! More food!

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.370
Hey, Lina...

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:09.710
Oh? Amelia?

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:13.040
Aren't you with Zelgadis?

00:12:13.110 --> 00:12:15.380
With Zelgadis
looking that beautiful...

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:17.420
...l'll bet he took those
great breasts, nice figure...

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:20.380
...and killer butt and got
himself a date somewhere.

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:21.940
I don't care!

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.490
Oh, come on!

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:36.060
I've found you, Lina Inverse!

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:39.070
A Monster?!

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:51.520
My name is Evia. Lina Inverse,
I have come to take your life!

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:55.340
No boys allowed here, pal!
Now get lost!

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.510
Elmekia Lance!

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.650
The Elmekia Lance!

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:03.520
Oh... To be expected
of a Monster!

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.120
Hmpf! Not bad...

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:07.220
Hurry up and do something!

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:09.460
It's your fault
we're in this mess!

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:10.930
Can't... breathe!

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:16.770
C-C-Cold...

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:18.870
I won't miss this time!

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:20.610
I beg your pardon!

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:26.910
You little witch!

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:30.890
Elmekia Lance!

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:38.490
All right!

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:41.930
Well done!
What a wonderful combination!

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.400
Thank you...

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:47.910
But there may be more
Monsters on the way!

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:50.540
Let's move it!

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:52.980
But what about Mr. Zelgadis?

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:55.040
Don't worry about Zelgadis.

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:57.910
Didn't he say he was on his way
to the purification spring?

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.970
Well, I guess so, but...

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:01.080
Come on! Let's go!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:02.850
Oh! Please wait for me!

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:05.050
Oh! Wait for me, too, guys!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.530
Purification spring, eh?

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.350
Miwan!

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:36.350
You think that, by destroying it...

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:39.650
...you won't have to become
a shrine maiden. Right?

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:43.590
But will that really
change your future?

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:54.200
Won't you come with us?

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:06.450
That was the princess!
Move it!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.220
Let Miwan go!

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:30.900
M- Mr. Zelgadis!

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:33.310
What's going on?!

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:36.540
You're too late.

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:45.980
Evia!

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:48.390
Huh?! I thought
we beat him already!

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:54.090
I get it.
Your true form is water!

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:58.760
Exactly! That ice puppet
before and my body now...

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:01.810
...are merely forms
I create with my body.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.610
You... You damned Monster!

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:07.470
Mr. Zelgadis!
I'll help you right now!

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:08.580
Blast!

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:09.710
Hold it!

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:12.620
If you're not careful, Zel and
the girl will get caught in it.

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:13.710
But...

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:15.310
Calm down, Amelia!

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:17.010
Curse you, Lina!

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:19.760
How dare you
use me as a shield!

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:22.590
Look out. Here he comes.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.800
Oh, you dodged it.

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:34.600
But while you dodge,
these two people are suffering.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:40.850
Zelgadis!
You... You dirty cheater!

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:43.850
Here I come.
Please don't dodge this time.

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:47.080
Lina!

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.050
Miss Lina!

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:50.020
And now for you.

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:01.430
Miwan...

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:03.990
Why, you!

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:07.000
You're not as good as
the rumors say, Lina Inverse!

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:08.970
Well, it's time I finished you!

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.570
Megiddo Flare!

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:11.300
What?!

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:14.140
Zelgadis!

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:20.020
lmpossible! She's using magic
to turn her body to!

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:32.350
All right! Way to go!

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:35.360
It can't be... Miss Lulu!

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:36.560
It's Zelgadis.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:39.630
I don't want to
deceive you any more.

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:45.980
All right!
It's way easier to move now!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.740
What?! You're a man, too?!
That must mean...

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:51.680
You're a man, too!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:55.550
Huh?! ME?!
Oh, you've got guts, pal!

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:56.680
Wait!

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:58.750
This one's mine.

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:00.020
Zelgadis?!

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:01.450
You fool!

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:05.360
I'll crush that body of yours!

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:08.460
RAH TILT!!!

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.870
You did it, Mr. Zelgadis!

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:27.580
But, don't you think
that overdid it a little?

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:36.230
Well, I guess Zel
was really mad at him.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.660
Still, I'm not that surprised.

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:40.800
Don't move!

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:45.670
You have some nerve!

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:51.570
Not only do you filthy men enter
our country disguised as women...

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:54.310
...but you even defile
our purification spring!

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:57.620
Unforgivable!
You shall be executed right here!

00:18:58.180 --> 00:18:59.980
Mother, stop this, please!

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:01.280
I've had enough!

00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:02.620
M- Miwan!

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:04.990
I'm through living this lie!

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:19.800
Miwan, no!

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:28.480
Abandon now thy false ways.

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:36.650
Abandon thy heavy heart
and repent all thy deeds.

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:40.590
I see now! In order to
become a shrine maiden...

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:43.030
...they have to purify their hearts...

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:46.030
...by using this as a vessel
which reveals all their secrets!

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:48.090
Where were you until now?!

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:50.830
Another wild goose chase...

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:54.430
Mother... I now abandon
this lie I live!

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:59.300
That's right, Miwan! Tell the
queen how you really feel!

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:07.640
It's true. I'm really...

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:09.210
...a man!

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:17.320
Though I was born male,
mother hid that from everyone...

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:19.090
...and raised me as a girl.

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:22.330
But I'm going to change my
future with my own hands!

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:27.930
Thank you for giving me the courage
to confess the truth, Miss Lulu...

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.740
I mean Zelgadis!

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.710
I don't know exactly
what's going on here...

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:34.750
...but does this all
mean "case closed"?

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:36.180
Which means...

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:39.650
You mean you?!
Well, actually, so am I!

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:41.550
Wow! You, too!

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:48.480
Finally, I can admit
I'm not a woman!

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:51.360
It was pretty hard keeping
this up all the time!

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:55.160
Don't tell me they're ALL!!!!

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:57.900
I just don't
believe any of this...
